exports[`DocumentInviteEmail > matches the plain text body 1`] = `
"YOU'VE BEEN
INVITED

Alex shared the document "Trip to the Alps" with you in pencil case.

Sign in with this email address to open it. We send a code to the same address, so there is no password to remember.

Open the document https://pencilcase.app/doc/doc-id

The link opens this one document and nothing else. If you were not expecting it, you can ignore this email."
`;

